OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 30 MAR
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GLinton Stephens introduces an
OL,11,     Gafternoon of specially made
OL,12,     Grecordings including a live
OL,13,     Gconcert from Wigmore Hall with
OL,14,     GPaul Lewis, the Vertavo String
OL,15,     GQuartet and Tim Gibbs.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Hildegard
OL,17,     Fof Bingen and Isabella Leonarda
OL,18,     GHildegard's life is changed for
OL,19,     Gever after she reveals a long-
OL,20,     Gheld secret. With Donald Macleod.
